## The reviewed pair remains unchanged

The [four-page student PDF](PHYS3810_Full_Course_Student_Setup_v0.1_REVIEW_DRAFT.pdf)
and its [original Markdown companion](FULL_COURSE_SETUP_DRAFT.md) are exact
**document v0.1 PREPUBLICATION REVIEW DRAFTS**, retained as dated review
references. No PDF has been edited, regenerated, optimized, or reissued.
The Markdown companion still matches that PDF's reviewed visible content.

Their statement that the full-course download is **unpublished** describes the
review-time state and is **outdated after this prerelease**. It does not describe
the availability of this public ZIP. Use the current setup page for the public
download and entry route; use the preserved pair as review references.

The current setup page changes only the reviewed Markdown's title, edition,
initial availability paragraph, and an added publication note. All six fenced
blocks and the rest of its instructions are unchanged. This is a disclosed
publication adaptation, not a newly reviewed PDF edition.

